WEBVTT

00:07:59.077 --> 00:08:01.780
Bil sem privilegiran, da sem ga imel.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.671
Nisem bil dober učenec.

00:08:03.671 --> 00:08:06.339
Hodil sem v javno šolo v New Yorku

00:08:06.339 --> 00:08:08.979
in mi sploh ni šlo dobro.

00:08:08.979 --> 00:08:12.791
Imam prepis vseh ocen

00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:15.234
od vrtca do kolidža.

00:08:15.234 --> 00:08:17.504
Hotel sem jih videti, 
ko sem pisal svojo prvo knjigo.

00:08:17.504 --> 00:08:19.543
Hotel sem videti, če me spomin ni varal.

00:08:19.543 --> 00:08:22.818
Ni me varal niti malo. (smeh)

00:08:22.818 --> 00:08:25.606
Same trojke.

00:08:25.606 --> 00:08:28.047
Končno sem se prebil skozi srednjo šolo,

00:08:28.047 --> 00:08:30.126
se vpisal na City College v New Yorku